,"_70":297,"_72":-5,"_74":298,"_76":299,"_78":300,"_80":260,"_82":301,"_84":302,"_86":101,"_87":151,"_88":-5},{"_66":278,"_68":279,"_70":280,"_72":-5,"_74":281,"_76":282,"_78":283,"_80":81,"_82":284,"_84":285,"_86":101,"_87":88,"_88":286},{"_66":254,"_68":255,"_70":256,"_72":-5,"_74":257,"_76":258,"_78":259,"_80":260,"_82":261,"_84":262,"_86":101,"_87":88,"_88":263},{"_66":246,"_68":247,"_70":248,"_72":-5,"_74":249,"_76":250,"_78":251,"_80":148,"_82":252,"_84":253,"_86":101,"_87":151,"_88":-5},{"_66":236,"_68":237,"_70":238,"_72":-5,"_74":239,"_76":240,"_78":241,"_80":148,"_82":242,"_84":243,"_86":101,"_87":151,"_88":-5},{"_66":220,"_68":221,"_70":222,"_72":-5,"_74":223,"_76":224,"_78":225,"_80":81,"_82":226,"_84":227,"_86":101,"_87":88,"_88":228},{"_66":201,"_68":202,"_70":203,"_72":-5,"_74":204,"_76":205,"_78":206,"_80":207,"_82":208,"_84":209,"_86":101,"_87":88,"_88":210},{"_66":183,"_68":184,"_70":185,"_72":-5,"_74":186,"_76":187,"_78":188,"_80":148,"_82":189,"_84":180,"_86":101,"_87":88,"_88":190},{"_66":173,"_68":174,"_70":175,"_72":-5,"_74":176,"_76":177,"_78":178,"_80":81,"_82":179,"_84":180,"_86":101,"_87":151,"_88":-5},{"_66":155,"_68":156,"_70":157,"_72":-5,"_74":158,"_76":159,"_78":160,"_80":148,"_82":161,"_84":162,"_86":101,"_87":88,"_88":163},{"_66":142,"_68":143,"_70":144,"_72":-5,"_74":145,"_76":146,"_78":147,"_80":148,"_82":149,"_84":150,"_86":101,"_87":151,"_88":-5},{"_66":126,"_68":127,"_70":128,"_72":-5,"_74":129,"_76":130,"_78":131,"_80":81,"_82":132,"_84":133,"_86":101,"_87":88,"_88":134},{"_66":67,"_68":69,"_70":71,"_72":73,"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":79,"_80":81,"_82":83,"_84":85,"_86":9,"_87":88,"_88":89},"id","m7ul4psbkb5zyp0t254fr986o","title","Anthropic 投资需求火热，承销商拟将 IPO 目标估值上调回 $1.5T 或更高","summary","FT 报道，因投资者需求旺盛，Anthropic 承销商计划上调 IPO 定价，把目标估值拉回 $1.5T 或更高。周二文件设定 $70-$78 的发行区间，计入员工期权和受限股后对应 $1.26T-$1.41T 估值；若定价超出区间，募资将超过 $100B，其中 Google、Nvidia 和 Microsoft 将按 IPO 价格投资 $26B。","reason","报道补充了定价区间、募资用途和三大科技公司的入股安排，可帮助读者理解这桩 IPO 的资金结构与定价逻辑。","source",{"_125":91},"publishedAt","2026-11-11T00:58:06.000Z","timelineAt","2026-11-11T01:14:24.726Z","category","industry","tags",[123,124],"score",85,"selected","channel","x",{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97,"_98":99,"_100":101,"_102":103},"authorName","Rohan Paul","handle","rohanpaul_ai","avatarUrl","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1816185267037859840%2FFd18CH0v_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=523bcdd35be07eb7","avatarSrcSet","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1816185267037859840%2FFd18CH0v_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=c9e4e62587b75639 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1816185267037859840%2FFd18CH0v_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=523bcdd35be07eb7 96w","media",[108],"article",false,"quoted",{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_104":105,"_106":107},"text","Anthropic forges ahead with IPO roadshow\nThey will sell up to 825M shares at $70 to $78 each, a range that values it at as much as $1.4T.\n\nAt the top of that range the deal raises about $64.4B, and Anthropic itself takes roughly $62.5B from 801M new shares.\n\nExisting stockholders are selling only 23.6M shares, so almost all the cash funds the company instead of letting early investors exit.\n\nEarlier talk had pointed to as much as $2T, and the cut follows a tech selloff and midterm results showing voters souring on AI data centers.\n\nEven reduced, the price sits above the $1.25T private valuation OpenAI reached last week.\n\nShares are expected to start trading on Nasdaq under the ticker “ANT” as soon as Thursday or Friday next week.","translation","Anthropic 推进 IPO 路演\n他们将以每股 70 至 78 美元的价格出售最多 8.25 亿股，该区间对公司的估值最高达 1.4 万亿美元。\n\n按该区间上限计算，此次交易募资约 644 亿美元，Anthropic 自身从 8.01 亿股新股中筹得约 625 亿美元。\n\n现有股东仅出售 2360 万股，因此几乎全部资金都流入公司，而非让早期投资者退出。\n\n早前传闻曾指向高达 2 万亿美元的估值，此次下调发生在科技股抛售以及中期选举结果显示选民对 AI 数据中心不满之后。\n\n即便下调，该价格仍高于 OpenAI 上周达到的 1.25 万亿美元私募估值。\n\n预计该股最早将于下周周四或周五在纳斯达克开始交易，股票代码为“ANT”。",{"_109":110,"_111":112,"_113":114,"_115":116,"_117":118,"_119":120,"_121":-5,"_122":-5},"kind","image","url","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=24fca0600b1e3d48","fullUrl","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=2c75f4a09eac86a1","srcSet","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=e971c397c28dc34c 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=24fca0600b1e3d48 720w","width",761,"height",1026,"alt","poster","行业动态","Anthropic","name","a73jtskj9qghshz9b0pskrce2","CoreWeave 三季度营收增 168% 至 $3.66B，净亏损扩大至 $7.09 亿","CoreWeave 三季度营收同比增长 168% 至 $3.66B，但净亏损扩大逾 6 倍至 $7.09 亿，净利息支出升至 $846M。资本开支后现金消耗 $7.5B，合同积压升至 $132.5B，2026 年营收指引上调至 $13B-$13.3B；公司持有约 $4.12B 现金对近 $47B 债务，过去一个月股价跌超 40%，财报后盘后涨约 6%。",{"_125":91},"2026-11-11T00:53:50.000Z","2026-11-11T01:14:24.733Z",[123],74,{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97,"_98":135,"_100":101,"_102":-5},[136],{"_109":110,"_111":137,"_113":138,"_115":139,"_117":140,"_119":141,"_121":-5,"_122":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=dcd3140f15806e08","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=34db2551683a9a57","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=4ca7bfe669c9cd13 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=dcd3140f15806e08 720w",1025,931,"e4kab2ku3cujtz0fczna6fq07","Seedream 5.5 上线 ComfyUI Partner Nodes","Seedream 5.5 现已通过 Partner Nodes 在 ComfyUI 中可用，这是一个支持文本生成和图像编辑的多模态模型。能力方向包括原生 RGBA 透明生成、多轮局部编辑（只改描述区域、其余画面保持不变）、可读文字的海报与信息图排版、更真实的肖像质感以及提示词控光。",{"_125":154},"2026-11-11T00:42:03.000Z","2026-11-11T01:23:20.670Z","ai-products",[152,153],65,"news","产品更新","图像生成","Comfy Blog","q4uvrlk5c8jhveka0pzngb0mw","Anthropic 向 Pro、Max、Ultra 和 Team 用户发放一次免费全量额度重置","Anthropic 为所有 Pro、Max、Ultra 和 Team 用户提供一次免费全量重置，覆盖全部模型和限额，12月10日下午2:00（太平洋时间）前可随时使用。官方称此前修复的几个小问题曾多消耗额度，为补偿已用尽周限额的用户而发放，入口在 Settings > Usage 或 http://clau.de/reset。",{"_125":172},"2026-11-11T01:06:48.000Z","2026-11-11T01:30:22.669Z",[152,124],54,{"_90":164,"_92":165,"_94":166,"_96":167,"_98":168,"_100":101,"_102":169},"Ado","adocomplete","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=342a0194b73864a1","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=57846a058e5be3dd 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=342a0194b73864a1 96w",[],{"_90":170,"_92":170,"_104":171,"_106":-5},"ClaudeDevs","We've given all Pro, Max, Ultra, and Team users one free full reset, across all models and limits. Use it anytime before December 10 at 2:00PM PT.\n\nWe recently fixed a few small issues that used more limits than intended, and the Fable resets didn't do much for those of you who'd already hit your weekly limits for all models. While these issues didn't affect everyone, we want to make up for the trouble.\n\nYou'll find it in Settings > Usage, or at http://clau.de/reset.","Ado Kukic","mrgpwu6mwuv4bxgvcgvpa4zll","PFN 小鼠尾静脉自动注射机器人 AUTiv 获第12届机器人大奖“日本机械工业联合会 会长奖”","Preferred Networks 设计开发的小鼠尾静脉自动注射系统 AUTiv 在第12届机器人大奖中获“日本机械工业联合会 会长奖”，评审认可其高精度给药、降低穿刺失误与实验者针刺事故风险。AUTiv 通过 4K 立体相机图像与深度学习识别尾静脉位置，可自动完成约 0.3mm 尾静脉穿刺与给药，国内已交付约 20 台并决定追加生产。",{"_125":182},"2026-11-10T16:00:00.000Z","2026-11-11T01:30:22.824Z",[123,181],44,"具身智能","Preferred Networks：AI 研究与产品","dslz00n65ld89m3spp8r42f06","MiniCPM-OCR 接入 Hermes Agent","太棒了，Luis！🚀 很高兴看到 MiniCPM-OCR 集成进 Hermes Agent。感谢你构建并分享给社区！💙",{"_125":200},"2026-11-11T01:33:38.000Z","2026-11-11T01:43:23.038Z",[152,199],{"_90":191,"_92":191,"_94":192,"_96":193,"_98":194,"_100":101,"_102":195},"OpenBMB","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5d58307d0c8c011b","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=0f090400f960fbf9 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5d58307d0c8c011b 96w",[],{"_90":196,"_92":197,"_104":198,"_106":-5},"Luis Poveda","povedaai","Introducing the MiniCPM-OCR plugin for Hermes Agent.\n\nThis is a problem I have experienced myself: LLMs by themselves are not always very good at OCR; sometimes I have needed another model specialized in it to solve complex document parsing.\n\nFor example, recently I have had difficulties understanding some physician recipes and other manuscripts.\n\nThis is where MiniCPM-OCR comes in. You can use the model and harness you already have to utilize a best-in-class OCR model by @OpenBMB.\n\n@Teknium @NousResearch \n\nCode: https://github.com/PovedaAqui/minicpm-ocr-hermes\nPR: https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pull/150268","MCP/工具调用","面壁智能 OpenBMB","ygrmt2d79ov5ppr361blm795b","简短提示词让小型开源模型 NLI 表现追平复杂方法","一篇论文发现，仅用带少量示例的简短直接提示词（In-Context Learning），小型开源 LLM 在自然语言推理（NLI）任务上就能追平更复杂的提示方法。",{"_125":91},"2026-11-11T01:39:00.000Z","2026-11-11T01:45:24.558Z","paper",[218,219],40,{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97,"_98":211,"_100":101,"_102":-5},[212],{"_109":110,"_111":213,"_113":214,"_115":215,"_117":216,"_119":217,"_121":-5,"_122":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzqptsbQAAWDhK.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=7f69b59160ae6569","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzqptsbQAAWDhK.png&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=0fe5219c9c8f9813","/api/img-proxy?u=htt