177c5ca2ac1824a9","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzrjFSbMAAfbbf.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=5b9d2b1a88045bdf","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzrjFSbMAAfbbf.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=b52dc7a2b04deac7 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzrjFSbMAAfbbf.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=177c5ca2ac1824a9 720w",787,1075,"政策/监管","paeuetl01de8gg5m0zp2fp66p","阿里官宣千问 Qwen4 即将发布，Qwen4-Max 预览版已上线","阿里巴巴官宣新一代千问大模型 Qwen4 即将发布，称知识理解更深入、世界感知更立体，Coding 与 Agentic 能力持续进阶。Qwen4-Max 预览版已首发上线阿里 Token Plan，限时最低 1 折可体验；千问办公、Qoder、千问 App、QwenStudio 等已接入新模型。",{"_125":245},"2026-11-11T02:10:29.663Z","2026-11-11T02:48:24.723Z",[303],62,"模型发布","qkzvg84jth5fx1k2yiqkkaxhr","SpaceX 与 SINGULUS 签约引进 HJT 太阳能电池产线，支持超 100GW 设备规模生产 Starmind 卫星","SpaceX 11 月 11 日宣布与德国太阳能设备制造商 SINGULUS 签署重大供应合同，引进异质结（HJT）太阳能电池整套生产线，为得州工厂加速制造 Starmind 太空 AI 计算卫星提供电池供应。",{"_125":245},"2026-11-11T02:53:33.477Z","2026-11-11T03:27:39.842Z",[123,311],"xAI","toajz2icztxxscbv2l1k3ascx","Qwen4 预览版上线千问APP，千问Go!会员可抢先体验","千问APP已同步接入Qwen4-Max预览版，用户通过千问Go!即可抢先体验。全新一代千问大模型Qwen4即将发布，知识理解、世界感知以及Coding与Agentic能力均有进阶。11月11日起千问Go!会员推出限时折扣，最低9.9元。",{"_125":320},"2026-11-11T03:40:19.000Z","2026-11-11T03:41:53.500Z",[152],47,"公众号：千问APP","znkg4gbpmzwsegyun87hej1lp","OCC 发布监管框架，可自主移动资金的银行 AI Agent 被列入最高风险层级","美国国家银行监管机构 OCC 发布评估银行 AI Agent 的监管框架，依据 Executive Order 14434 要求，用 \"Super Intelligence\"（SI）一词涵盖此前所称的人工智能。框架将可自主移动资金的支付 Agent 列入最高风险层级，与实时信贷决策和金融市场准入同档。",{"_125":91},"2026-11-11T03:20:32.000Z","2026-11-11T03:47:44.887Z",[294,337],61,{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97,"_98":330,"_100":101,"_102":-5},[331],{"_109":110,"_111":332,"_113":333,"_115":334,"_117":335,"_119":336,"_121":-5,"_122":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=5dbd770b54dd501b","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=7dfe944c4d75b8f9","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=47cfe10007fb4af4 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=5dbd770b54dd501b 720w",1066,1411,"Agent","vrln9dterc8u3q8exet5pimqp","MiniMax H3 Image 图像模型在 Runware Day 0 上线","MiniMax 官方感谢 Runware 对 MiniMax H3 Image 的 Day 0 支持，该图像模型基于开源视频模型 H3 构建，定位广告创意、电商与规模化内容生产。官方称模型支持最多 16 张参考图输入，出图速度提升 2–3 倍；Runware 版本输出最高 20 MP，提供 1K/2K/4K 预设与 1:3 到 3:1 宽高比，H3 Image Highspeed 速度为 2 倍，图像输出 $3.80 每百万 token 起，两款模型 4K 输出 11 月 17 日前五折。",{"_125":356},"2026-11-11T03:43:19.000Z","2026-11-11T04:05:44.860Z",[303,153],60,{"_90":347,"_92":348,"_94":349,"_96":350,"_98":351,"_100":101,"_102":352},"MiniMax (official)","MiniMax_AI","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1875100548535574529%2FVxHk9HyU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=88dd5bd9dc483876","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1875100548535574529%2FVxHk9HyU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=14a8c0d27b515c98 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1875100548535574529%2FVxHk9HyU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=88dd5bd9dc483876 96w",[],{"_90":353,"_92":354,"_104":355,"_106":-5},"Runware","runware","@MiniMax_AI H3 Image & H3 Image Highspeed are live on Runware on D0\n\nMiniMax built its new image model on H3, its popular open-weight video model, calling it the strongest open-weight image model released so far.\n\n- Edit with up to 16 reference images\n- Output up to 20 MP, with 1K, 2K and 4K presets or exact width and height\n- Aspect ratios from 1:3 to 3:1\n- H3 Image Highspeed runs at 2x the speed, for quick edits and fast iterations\n\nImage output from $3.80 per million tokens, with 50% off 4K outputs on both models through November 17","MiniMax","thu1nes9bh49ngumfxgvaa25f","MiniMax H3 Image 开放权重图像模型上线 fal，约 10 秒生成 4K 图像","MiniMax 宣布 H3 Image 图像模型在 fal 上线，官方称约 10 秒即可生成 4K 图像。模型能遵循复杂提示词、精确编辑，并支持游戏与 3D 资产生成，官方表示其速度足以支撑智能体和生产力工具。引用的 fal 介绍称其支持原生 4K 生成与编辑、多参考图组合及精确文本渲染。",{"_125":356},"2026-11-11T03:42:42.000Z","2026-11-11T04:05:44.869Z",[152,153],55,{"_90":347,"_92":348,"_94":349,"_96":350,"_98":366,"_100":101,"_102":367},[],{"_90":368,"_92":368,"_104":369,"_106":-5},"fal","MiniMax H3 Image is now available on fal.\n\nThe latest open-weights image model from @MiniMax_AI delivers exceptional visual quality at lightning-fast speeds, with powerful generation and editing capabilities.\n\nGenerate and edit images in native 4K, combine multiple references, and render complex text with precision.","cj78tkkh6hnytvqy2ojn0tb34","Claude Fable 5.2 用代码吞噬审美，作者实测对比 Gemini 4 Carbon","作者实测 Claude Fable 5.2，认为其审美能力是 Benchmark 难以评估但明显超越同期上线的 Gemini 4 Carbon 的关键差异，并展示社区用其写 Python 控制 Blender 做动画、写代码作画的案例。其中一幅画作未用图像模型，纯代码模拟颜料引擎画了70万笔，作者据此判断大模型正借助代码吞嘝虚拟世界中原本被认为无法计算的美。",{"_125":388},"2026-11-11T04:03:33.000Z","2026-11-11T04:09:42.364Z","opinion",[385,386,387,124],66,{"_90":380,"_92":381,"_94":382,"_96":383,"_98":384,"_100":9,"_102":-5},"数字生命卡兹克","Khazix0918","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=35acd4722c4cf54e","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=dfb543046f73574a 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=35acd4722c4cf54e 96w",[],"大佬观点","编码","多模态","卡兹克","xshgfc1vcvgrdkvnomagmefwy","Anthropic 修订版 S1 文件披露与 Microsoft 和 Google 超 100 亿美元级新算力协议","Anthropic 在当日修订的 S1 文件中披露与 Microsoft 和 Google 达成超 100 亿美元的新协议。Microsoft 承诺到 2033 年 6 月支出至少 472 亿、最高 492 亿美元，Google 最低承诺从约 1145 亿升至约 1213 亿美元，两笔均不可撤销、无论是否使用容量都须付款。文件还提到上季度短期算力支出 50 亿美元且价格明显更高。","S1 修正案披露了 Microsoft 和 Google 云承诺的最新金额和不问使用照付的条款，可以据此理解 Anthropic 的算力开支结构。",{"_125":91},"2026-11-11T04:14:38.000Z","2026-11-11T04:18:44.594Z",[123,124,244,407],84,{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97,"_98":399,"_100":101,"_102":400},[401],{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_104":105,"_106":107},{"_109":110,"_111":402,"_113":403,"_115":404,"_117":405,"_119":406,"_121":-5,"_122":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0QfMVaAAA8mdU.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=3296bae964314745","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0QfMVaAAA8mdU.png&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=2ee72ef70228f062","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0QfMVaAAA8mdU.png&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=a65560ec7ccd283c 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0QfMVaAAA8mdU.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=3296bae964314745 720w",1228,1501,"Google","mu4jpi0jbf4dph1o8d1lodxj6","研究：LLM 道德选择缺乏稳定价值排序","一项论文发现，LLM 的道德选择往往缺乏稳定的价值排序，对答案取平均会造出虚假的、类人的道德层级。研究者让包括 GPT-5.2、Gemini、DeepSeek 在内的 5 个 LLM 对成对道德违规行为做比较，并直接从 next-token 输出读取概率。",{"_125":91},"2026-11-11T04:08:45.000Z","2026-11-11T04:18:44.602Z",[218,423,424,407,425],{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97,"_98":416,"_100":101,"_102":-5},[417],{"_109":110,"_111":418,"_113":419,"_115":420,"_117":421,"_119":422,"_121":-5,"_122":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0Paw5boAAiCK-.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=39bb113d167265a8","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0Paw5boAAiCK-.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=503403f78906a6d3","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0Paw5boAAiCK-.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=e409fc659982c709 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0Paw5boAAiCK-.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=39bb113d167265a8 720w",1563,1566,"安全/对齐","OpenAI","DeepSeek","okbcich8urab84lqhg41q297l","Viggle JST-2 生成可动画 3DGS 角色场景","用我们的 JST-2 模型生成的可动画 3DGS 角色和场景 👀",{"_125":444},"2026-11-11T03:52:56.000Z","2026-11-11T04:18:47.073Z",[152,443],41,{"_90":435,"_92":435,"_94":436,"_96":437,"_98":438,"_100":101,"_102":439},"ViggleAI","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2103212981483896832%2F_Je68a_F_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=02ce7a38340dda9e","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2103212981483896832%2F_Je68a_F_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=6998658d32b08bcc 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2103212981483896832%2F_Je68a_F_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=02ce7a38340dda9e 96w",[],{"_90":440,"_92":441,"_104":442,"_106":-5},"Nan Ha","nan_in_space","I used Fable 5.2 to build an interactive web piece where you walk a girl through eight worlds. Jump through a portal into each new one with a dive, a leap, or a cartwheel.\n\nThe girl and scenes are all 3DGS, each generated from a single image. \n\nBreakdown & playable link 🧵","视频","Viggle AI","xdfuy23o82a5n5wjv75ya1lfj","三大场景横测 Seedream 5.5 与 GPT Image 2.6：30 轮改图不崩、27 图层一键分离","作者实测火山引擎新发布的 Seedream 5.5，与 GPT Image 2.6 在同一底图上连续修改 30 轮，Seedream 5.5 人物与画面保持稳定，Image 2.6 出现明显形变和油腻感。",{"_125":460},"2026-11-11T04:05:27.000Z","2026-11-11T04:34:42.777Z","tip",[459,153,276],{"_90":454,"_92":455,"_94":456,"_96":457,"_98":458,"_100":9,"_102":-5},"卡尔的AI沃茨","aiwarts","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1685356596204040192%2FDYVeb0ww_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=d898f917214ca0c4","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1685356596204040192%2FDYVeb0ww_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=4db4e3504c4bbc31 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1685356596204040192%2FDYVeb0ww_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=d898f917214ca0c4 96w",[],"教程/实践","卡尔的 AI 沃茨","qdk4fnin9kq2znn7z12gffj6y","阿里 Qwen Code 1.0 发布：Qoder 与 Qwen Code Harness 能力融合开源","阿里发布 Qwen Code 1.0 Preview，将 Qoder 中打磨的 Harness 能力融入 Qwen Code 融合开源，为开发者提供可嵌入自身产品的 Agent 运行基础。",{"_125":245},"2026-11-11T04:20:07.900Z","2026-11-11T04:47:40.284Z",[152,469,337,386],69,"开源生态","en4o1mjci8petvdc6m3wrbk09","OpenAI 在 AI Engineer Code Summit 讲解 Codex 云端、语音与 dots 新工作方式","Richard MacManus 报道 AI Engineer Code Summit 上 OpenAI 开发者体验工程师 Dominik Kundel 和 Charlie Guo 的 Codex 工作坊。",{"_125":477},"2026-11-11T04:49:48.000Z","2026-11-11T04:51:41.243Z",[459,337,386,424],"Latent Space","xh862prfqdnfa0mpystjxvcqr","AWS CEO Matt Garman 称未来几年算力仍将供不应求","AWS CEO Matt Garman 在访谈中表示，当前需求远超供给，预计算力短缺将持续未来几年。他还认为 AI 推理规模仍不到最终规模的 1%，AWS 正以每 14 秒增加一块 GPU 的速度扩容，并预计云业务未来五到十年可达每年 1 万亿美元收入。",{"_125":487},"2026-11-11T04:35:34.000Z","2026-11-11T05:05:28.446Z",[123],59,{"_90":487,"_92":488,"_94":489,"_96":490,"_98":491,"_100":101,"_102":492},"Alex Heath","alexeheath","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1983378648787988480%2FcGjEMRvw_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=e1d581e1039e0b6d","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1983378648787988480%2FcGjEMRvw_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=367d8ad1238b793c 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1983378648787988480%2FcGjEMRvw_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=e1d581e1039e0b6d 96w",[494],{"_90":487,"_92":488,"_104":493,"_106":-5},"AWS CEO on building a $1 trillion business\n\nAmazon thinks its cloud business could generate $1 trillion a year within the next five to ten years. I sit down with AWS CEO @mattsgarman in Seattle to understand what gives him that confidence and what could get in the way.\n\nGarman explains how AI is pushing companies to move their core operations into the cloud, accelerating the business AWS spent two decades building. We discuss why he thinks inference, the computing required to run AI models, is still below 1 percent of its eventual scale. He says AWS is adding one GPU every 14 seconds and expects capacity shortages for another couple of years. I ask how he decides who gets the GPUs, why he holds capacity back for startups that don’t exist yet, and where he sees risk in the industry’s spending.\n\nRecorded right after the midterm elections, our conversation also covers the backlash against data centers, what the industry needs to do to win over communities, and why he sees deserts as more promising than space.\n\nI also ask about the reset inside Amazon’s Nova team and whether it still intends to compete at the frontier of AI. We get into selling Trainium chips outside AWS, the rise of inference providers like Baseten and Fireworks, and Amazon’s big research bet on using mathematical proofs to help AI agents follow rules.\n\nTimestamps:\n00:00 AWS’s trillion-dollar bet\n02:24 How AI is accelerating cloud growth\n09:33 The cost of scaling AI\n14:10 The risks of the compute boom\n17:02 Why inference is still early\n20:03 The backlash against data centers\n28:21 Data centers in space, oceans and deserts\n31:38 The rise of AI inference providers\n33:53 AWS’s full-stack strategy\n36:52 Why AWS is selling Trainium chips\n38:11 How AWS allocates scarce compute\n40:10 AWS’s frontier AI ambitions\n41:37 Making AI agents safe\n46:31 Open vs. closed AI models\n49:14 Running AWS inside Amazon\n\nLinks:\nSpotify: https://open.spotify.com/episode/4uEHhddFRexDy3dYiCMNYc?si=6oDh50TITACVfyZj3MawYw\nYouTube: https://youtu.be/1C_MErgk2Z0\nSubstack: https://sources.news/p/aws-ceo-matt-garman-1-trillion\nApple Podcasts: https://sources.news/p/aws-ceo-matt-garman-1-trillion\n\nThanks to the show’s sponsors: @mercury, @meetgranola , and @Atlassian",{"_109":270,"_111":495,"_113":496,"_115":497,"_117":498,"_119":499,"_121":-5,"_122":495},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120374148904181760%2Fimg%2FMCKNtm5xrmzVVa44.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=4c444c67adaebc6c","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120374148904181760%2Fimg%2FMCKNtm5xrmzVVa44.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=00ca7f3cc6cf5afd","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120374148904181760%2Fimg%2FMCKNtm5xrmzVVa44.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=c256e811b9c20b71 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120374148904181760%2Fimg%2FMCKNtm5xrmzVVa44.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=4c444c67adaebc6c 720w",3840,2160,"qd3f4j2hd0t98tqf28iv7pu2j","百度发布 ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview，权重将于 11 月 25 日前开源","百度发布 ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview，是基于此前 Base 模型的首个后训练版本，总参数 280B、激活参数 14B，支持 1M 上下文。模型 API 已在千帆平台上线，权重将于 11 月 25 日前开源；官方展示了游戏开发、3D 建模、知识工作、视频创作等 Agent 场景成果，并称该版本为后训练中间版本，正式版仍将持续优化。","官方给出总参 280B、激活 14B、1M 上下文等规格和基准对比，可据此评估该模型在编码与 Agent 任务上的定位。",{"_125":508},"2026-11-11T05:31:29.313Z",[303,337,386,387],73,"百度文心 ERNIE 官方博客","ajjv9abs8vd20j05emcig98ai","WSJ：Anthropic 7 位创始人 IPO 各套现约 2.5 亿美元并保留控制权","WSJ 报道，Anthropic 7 位创始人将在 IPO 中各出售约 2.5 亿美元股票，每人保留约 180 亿美元持仓。据公司文件，每人出售近 3.4M 股，发行价区间预计 70 至 78 美元，上市预计下周进行，估值接近 1.3 万亿美元，募资 800 亿美元以上，部分通过包括 Google 在内的私募配售。","原文转述 WSJ 报道并给出招股文件细节，读者可以据此理解 Anthropic IPO 中创始人套现与双重股权控制安排。",{"_125":91},"2026-11-11T05:47:04.000Z","2026-11-11T05:50:31.081Z",[123,124],79,{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97,"_98":519,"_100":101,"_102":-5},[520],{"_109":110,"_111":521,"_113":522,"_115":523,"_117":524,"_119":525,"_121":-5,"_122":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0lhL-a8AAkz_A.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=9d62db88bba33313","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0lhL-a8AAkz_A.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=4ba8992431f187b0","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0lhL-a8AAkz_A.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=5e07c9efb7df8cd3 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0lhL-a8AAkz_A.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=9d62db88bba33313 720w",979,1013,"k0s9asp7ahp38drtj69gi5lye","英伟达CEO绯闻或波及芯片业","《华尔街日报》：出口管制支持者以这一事件为证，佐证他们对漏洞的警告\n\n“英伟达CEO的绯闻可能给这家全球顶级芯片设计公司乃至整个行业带来商业后果。\n\n尽管许多议员在提出法案时都提到了英伟达，但这些提案可能伤及其他芯片公司，包括英伟达的竞争对手AMD，甚至微软和OpenAI这类正试图在海外建设数据中心的科技巨头。”",{"_125":91},"2026-11-11T05:42:06.000Z","2026-11-11T05:50:31.090Z",[123,294,244,424],{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97,"_98":534,"_100":101,"_102":-5},[535],{"_109":110,"_111":536,"_113":537,"_115":538,"_117":539,"_119":540,"_121":-5,"_122":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0kP_ObsAAI-0y.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=152c8a806f494ae1","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0kP_ObsAAI-0y.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=f9aded521dc1044e","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0kP_ObsAAI-0y.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=f67e46d9b6cfa868 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0kP_ObsAAI-0y.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=152c8a806f494ae1 720w",1000,970,"n5rln8k1fte2zf0fzmh94uwf1","微软清华研究：GPU kernel 库故障多源于编译器与环境","微软与清华论文分析 7 个 GPU kernel 库的 300 条已关闭 GitHub issue，发现 60.33% 的故障源自编译器、构建系统或运行时环境，39.67% 源自 kernel 库本身。最大单一原因是驱动、CUDA、框架与软件包之间的不兼容，共 76 个 issue，占 25.33%。这类故障会导致 LLM 训练与推理任务崩溃、挂起或静默输出错误结果，且难以定位。",{"_125":91},"2026-11-11T05:25:48.000Z","2026-11-11T05:50:31.106Z",[218,556,244],{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97,"_98":549,"_100":101,"_102":-5},[550],{"_109":110,"_111":551,"_113":552,"_115":553,"_117":554,"_119":555,"_121":-5,"_122":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0hIK-bkAAghyl.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=9ae2f02aafab64eb","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0hIK-bkAAghyl.png&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=cad1dbc4a1846f00","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0hIK-bkAAghyl.png&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=77120900bea3d9ab 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0hIK-bkAAghyl.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=9ae2f02aafab64eb 720w",1841,1577,"部署/工程","yh3nhrzo0l3cjdlm68ukpavu8","Tether AI Research 发布 BotPsy 0.8B 端侧智能体模型","Tether AI Research 在 Hugging Face 博客介绍 BotPsy，一个基于 Qwen3.5-0.8B 的 0.8B 参数函数调用与智能体模型，面向端侧部署。",{"_125":566},"2026-11-11T05:01:16.000Z","2026-11-11T05:54:32.789Z",[303,564,337,469,565],"端侧","Hugging Face","Hugging Face 社区博客","stx3o06dcaqddy00bh71q7tzh","Cogent 与 OpenAI 打造企业网络防御工厂，用智能体自动修复漏洞","Cogent 基于 GPT-6.1 Sol、GPT-5.6 和 GPT-6 Astra 构建企业网络防御工厂，让 AI 智能体从漏洞调查一路做到验证修复。一家财富 1000 强汽车客户将关键漏洞平均修复时间降低 75%，一家财富 500 强 IT 服务客户把漏洞分诊吞吐量提升 5 倍。Cogent 称 OpenAI 模型在长时安全任务上推理更强、代码库幻觉更少，且成本效率优于其他供应商。",{"_125":575},"2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z","2026-11-11T05:54:39.837Z",[123,337,424],43,"OpenAI：官网动态","mt0bfi3auvowdcqvok8hos2y9","Adobe MAX 2026：Photoshop 新增重打光与倒影清理等 AI 功能","Adobe 在 Adobe MAX 2026 大会宣布为 Photoshop、Premiere、Lightroom、Illustrator、InDesign 等创意软件推出一批 AI 新功能。",{"_125":245},"2026-11-11T05:34:37.867Z","2026-11-11T06:05:29.678Z",[152,443,153],"vyigxm49rk69vlnuojrgfhsoh","趁 Fable5.2 智力最高期分享三个项目迭代提示语","作者分享趁 Fable5.2 上线初期智力最强时打磨的三个提示语，用于迭代已有项目。提示语1让模型结合代码、文档和历史改动找出受旧模型能力限制的低效实现；提示语2扫描 GitHub 仓库、本地项目和历史对话，筛选值得发布、落地 PR 或收尾的高价值候选；提示语3把最值得做的 10% 项目做成带代码动画或连续画面的交互式 HTML「项目进化图鉴」。",{"_125":590},"2026-11-11T06:38:44.000Z","2026-11-11T06:42:05.077Z",[459,386,337,124],"公众号：卡尔的AI沃茨","qysir2l829lq62ovav2mshayb","百度文心发布 ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview，11 月 25 日前开源权重","百度文心发布 ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview，这是此前 ERNIE 5.5 Flash Base 模型的首个后训练版本。模型总参数 280B、激活参数 14B，支持 1M 上下文，官方称在编程、3D 建模、知识工作、内容创作等方面表现有竞争力并保持较快解码速度。API 已在千帆平台上线，权重将于 11 月 25 日前开源；官方表示这是后训练中间版本，后续正式版本将继续优化。",{"_125":245},"2026-11-11T06:35:18.250Z","2026-11-11T06:45:28.845Z",[303,469],58,"g6doffajs5uthjvvcx3vld22t","TSMC 董事会批准最高 10 亿美元投资 Anthropic 与 OpenAI","据 WSJ，TSMC 董事会批准最高 10 亿美元的投资计划，按 IPO 每股发行价购买 Anthropic, PBC 普通股，金额不超过 5 亿美元，另购买最多 5 亿美元 OpenAI 优先股。同期 TSMC 公布 10 月营收同比增长 60%。",{"_125":91},"2026-11-11T06:28:26.000Z","2026-11-11T06:52:31.312Z",[123,124,424],{"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97,"_98":607,"_100":101,"_102":-5},[608],{"_109":110,"_111":609,"_113":610,"_115":611,"_117":612,"_119":613,"_121":-5,"_122":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0s7ioaIAAKMhR.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=2d42694bf236e85d","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0s7ioaIAAKMhR.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=121fc088098019ce","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0s7ioaIAAKMhR.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=056d71faee42d149 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHW0s7ioaIAAKMhR.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=2d42694bf236e85d 720w",981,1189,"z7959j9p3xukotnyyw38m2v23","Fish Audio 发布全双工语音模型 Live 3，短反应最快 186 ms","Fish Audio 发布面向实时语音 Agent 的全双工语音模型 Live 3，可在说话的同时持续收听，把话轮转换从流水线规则移入语音模型，用真实对话训练学会何时应答、等待或停止。短反应最快 186 ms，支持 Fish Agent Platform、API 和企业本地部署，定价每分钟 $0.035（至 2026 年 12 月 31 日，之后 $0.07），目前仅支持英语且未公布基准分数。",{"_125":621},"2026-11-11T04:43:53.000Z","2026-11-11T07:20:27.852Z",[152,277],"MarkTechPost","xi84x0rxlxpsuarnk6s8m4uwl","蚂蚁 inclusionAI 开源 SingVL_S1_4B 多模态决策模型","蚂蚁 inclusionAI 在 HuggingFace 发布基于 Qwen3.5 的 4B 多模态决策模型 SingVL_S1_4B，支持对文本或 JSON 及最多四张图片按 choice、noul、score 三类问题单次前向打分。",{"_125":629},"2026-11-11T03:58:51.000Z","2026-11-11T07:22:29.070Z",[303,387,219],"蚂蚁 inclusionAI：HuggingFace 新模型","bqxrrd9esj59au6k554hho17x","阿里Qwen4-Max预览上线及限时优惠","阿里巴巴Qwen4最新消息：\n\n- Qwen4-Max Preview在Qwen4正式发布前抢先上线\n\n- Qwen4-Max token定价将限时享受90%折扣\n\n- 新模型将内置于Qoder（用于编程）、Qwen Office和QwenStudio",{"_125":638},"2026-11-11T07:21:35.000Z","2026-11-11T07:24:32.772Z",[303],{"_90":638,"_92":639,"_94":640,"_96":641,"_98":642,"_100":101,"_102":643},"X.PIN","thexpin","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2032404709148102656%2Flaxt2sOU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=8ce2e896324d22a9","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2032404709148102656%2Flaxt2sOU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=b770b63c087e9238 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2032404709148102656%2Flaxt2sOU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=8ce2e896324d22a9 96w",[],{"_90":644,"_92":645,"_104":646,"_106":-5},"Qwen","Alibaba_Qwen","Qwen4 is coming.\n\nDeeper knowledge. Richer world understanding. Stronger coding and agentic capabilities.\n\nBuilt for real-world tasks — from complex coding and knowledge work to front-end builds and professional software workflows.\n\nQwen4-Max is now in preview on Alibaba’s Token Plan. You can also get early access to the new model on QwenWork, Qoder, Qwen APP, and QwenStudio.\n\nPut it to the test on a real problem. Show us what you build. 👀\n\nToken Plan: http://qwencloud.com/pricing/token-plan","j3g8gwmdk3hhhoz8ifkfdseoz","腾讯元宝搜索正式上线：可搜微信公众号与视频号，广告与答案明确区分","腾讯云宣布全新搜索产品「元宝搜索」正式上线，通过 so.qq.com 或将 QQ 浏览器切换引擎即可使用。产品基于元宝大模型能力重构搜索链路，依托千亿级索引覆盖全网网页、公众号、视频号和学术文献，接入 157 个权威信源，支持广告整块折叠、英文论文一键翻译，以及打字、说话、拍照搜索，并通过递归自我进化（RSI）机制持续改进体验。",{"_125":245},"2026-11-11T06:47:56.243Z","2026-11-11T07:25:30.035Z",[152,655],70,"搜索","all","tag","q","tab","time",{"_662":663,"_664":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
